<p>This endpoint <strong>requires a bearer token</strong>. Requests without a valid token answer <code>401</code>. Token holders are not rate limited.</p>
<pre><code>curl -H "Authorization: Bearer gb..." https://{{DOMAIN}}{{PREFIX}}{{EXAMPLE_PATH}}</code></pre>
<p>Tokens are issued to applications and partners by the getBible team; ask through <a href="https://getBible.net">getBible.net</a>.</p>
